flowchart TB
  CP[cmd/placement] --> PA[internal/placement/api]
  CG[cmd/glance] --> GA[internal/glance/api]
  PA --> PS[placement/service]
  PS --> PR[placement/repository]
  GA --> GS[glance/service]
  GS --> GR[glance/repository]
  GS --> Store[glance/store]
  PA --> Auth[shared/auth + middleware]
  GA --> Auth
  PR --> DB[(Placement DB)]
  GR --> GDB[(Glance metadata DB)]
  Store --> Bytes[(Image store)]
